WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:02.780
- Is it true you shaved the
mustache earlier this year?

00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:03.690
'Cause I don't know if I've seen you

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:05.490
without the mustache other than this time.

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:09.060
- That's the one day I
didn't have a mustache.

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:10.240
- That's so crazy.

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:12.180
- I started growin' it in the summer

00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:14.510
between the 11th and the 12th grade.

00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:17.520
And so I've been with my wife for 36 years

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:19.094
and she had never seen me without it

00:00:19.094 --> 00:00:22.180
because I never had a break

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:25.910
where I wasn't doin' either
a concert or a TV show.

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:29.940
And then when they
started canceling shows,

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:32.860
I thought, "All right, I
got time to shave it off."

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:34.250
And I didn't even say anything.

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:36.110
I just went in the
bathroom and shaved it off

00:00:36.110 --> 00:00:38.857
and I walked out and she
looked at me and said,

00:00:38.857 --> 00:00:40.980
"Oh wow, grow it back."

00:00:40.980 --> 00:00:45.943
And so I literally shaved
my lip one time as an adult.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:49.240
'Cause I didn't know how
long it took to grow it back,

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:52.580
but it takes between
two and three weeks, so.

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:54.040
- I guess, depending on the person.

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:56.880
You're a Chia Pet,
that's awesome. (laughs)

00:00:56.880 --> 00:00:59.140
- Well, but here was the funny thing,

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:01.230
so I posted it on Instagram

00:01:01.230 --> 00:01:02.737
and there were some people that were like,

00:01:02.737 --> 00:01:04.385
"Oh wow, you look younger."

00:01:04.385 --> 00:01:07.277
But Kelly, I swear, 80% of 'em were like,

00:01:07.277 --> 00:01:12.277
"No, no, no, you are
supposed to have a mustache.

00:01:13.030 --> 00:01:14.050
Grow it back."

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:15.700
- It's like Tom Selleck for me.

00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:16.870
You have to have a mustache.

00:01:16.870 --> 00:01:18.100
He has to have a mustache.

00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:20.484
It's just what we're used to.

00:01:20.484 --> 00:01:22.910
- Sam Elliott does not

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:24.170
look right without one.
- Sam Elliott, Sam Elliott,

00:01:24.170 --> 00:01:25.970
best cowboy ever.

00:01:25.970 --> 00:01:27.553
Yes, he has to have one too.

